        "code": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"pt-BR\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=1200\">\n  <title>NetScan Canon — AutoTest screenshot</title>\n  <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n  <link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@400;600&family=Plus+Jakarta+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"../../public/style.css\">\n  <style>\n    html, body { margin: 0; background: #08090d; min-height: 100%; }\n    body { display: flex; align-items: flex-start; justify-content: center; padding: 20px; }\n    .shot-wrap { width: 1080px; }\n    .ad-modal-backdrop { position: static !important; display: flex !important; opacity: 1 !important; visibility: visible !important; background: rgba(0,0,0,0.55); padding: 0; inset: auto; }\n    .ad-modal-backdrop.hidden { display: flex !important; }\n    .autotest-modal.ad-modal { width: 1080px; max-width: 1080px; height: 820px; max-height: 820px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; margin: 0; }\n    .autotest-run-scroll { flex: 1 1 0%; overflow: hidden; max-height: 420px; }\n    .hidden { display: none !important; }\n    details.autotest-remote-help[open] summary ~ * { display: block; }\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n  <div class=\"shot-wrap\">\n    <div class=\"ad-modal-backdrop autotest-modal-backdrop\">\n      <div class=\"ad-modal autotest-modal autotest-themed-modal glass-panel\">\n        <div class=\"modal-sticky-head\">\n          <header class=\"ad-modal-header\">\n            <div class=\"ad-modal-brand\">\n              <div class=\"ad-modal-icon autotest-modal-icon\">🔗</div>\n              <div class=\"ad-modal-heading\">\n                <h2>AutoTest de Rede</h2>\n                <p class=\"ad-modal-subtitle\">Gateway · DNS · Ping · TCP · Traceroute · Switch LLDP/CDP</p>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n            <button type=\"button\" class=\"ad-modal-close\" aria-hidden=\"true\">&times;</button>\n          </header>\n          <nav class=\"ad-modal-tabs modal-sticky-tabs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"autotest-tab ad-tab active\">AutoTest</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"autotest-tab ad-tab\">Switch</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"autotest-tab ad-tab\">Histórico</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"autotest-tab ad-tab\">Config</button></nav>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"ad-modal-body modal-sticky-body autotest-modal-body\">\n    <section class=\"ad-tab-panel autotest-run-panel\">\n      \n    <div class=\"ad-toolbar-card\">\n      <div class=\"ad-toolbar-row ad-toolbar-row-primary autotest-run-toolbar\">\n        <label class=\"ad-field autotest-profile-field\"><span class=\"ad-field-label\">Perfil</span>\n          <select class=\"ad-input ad-select\"><option>Escritório</option></select></label>\n        <label class=\"ad-field autotest-nic-field\"><span class=\"ad-field-label\">Placa</span>\n          <select class=\"ad-input ad-select\"><option>Primária</option></select></label>\n        <div class=\"ad-toolbar-actions autotest-run-actions\">\n          <button type=\"button\" class=\"btn btn-tertiary btn-sm\">Personalizar</button>\n          <button type=\"button\" class=\"btn btn-secondary btn-sm\">Executar AutoTest</button>\n          <button type=\"button\" class=\"btn btn-secondary btn-sm\">Executar remoto</button>\n          <button type=\"button\" class=\"btn btn-tertiary btn-sm\">Exportar PDF</button>\n          <button type=\"button\" class=\"btn btn-tertiary btn-sm\">Exportar CSV</button>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"autotest-remote-bar\">\n        <label class=\"ad-field autotest-remote-agent-field\"><span class=\"ad-field-label\">Estação remota</span>\n          <input class=\"ad-input\" value=\"WS-SALA-042\" readonly></label>\n        <button type=\"button\" class=\"btn btn-tertiary btn-sm\">Atualizar agentes</button>\n      </div>\n      <details class=\"autotest-remote-help\" open>\n        <summary>Passo 1 — instalar agente na estação (automático, estilo Veyon)</summary>\n        <p class=\"ad-section-hint\">Instala <strong>uma vez</strong> como serviço Windows — sobe com o PC, <strong>sem Node aberto</strong>.</p>\n        <div class=\"autotest-pairing-row\">\n          <button type=\"button\" class=\"btn btn-secondary btn-sm\">Gerar código de pareamento</button>\n          <span class=\"autotest-pairing-code\">A7K9-2M4X</span>\n        </div>\n        <pre class=\"autotest-remote-cmd\">.\\scripts\\install-autotest-agent-service.ps1 -ServerUrl \"http://10.50.12.5:3000\" -PairingCode \"A7K9-2M4X\"</pre>\n      </details>\n    </div>\n      <div class=\"autotest-run-scroll\">\n        <div class=\"autotest-empty\" style=\"padding:24px\">Selecione uma estação remota online e clique em <strong>Executar remoto</strong>.</div>\n      </div>\n      <footer class=\"autotest-status-dock\">\n        <div class=\"autotest-banner autotest-banner-footer autotest-banner-visible autotest-banner-rich\">\n          <div class=\"autotest-eng-banner\">\n            <div class=\"autotest-eng-head\"><span class=\"autotest-eng-verdict autotest-eng-verdict-warn\">PRONTO</span></div>\n            <p class=\"autotest-eng-line\">Pareie a estação remota · depois execute o AutoTest na LAN</p>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </footer>\n    </section></div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</body>\n</html>",
