        "code": "# Introdução às Generator functions em Python\r\n# generator = (n for n in range(1000000))\r\n\r\ndef generator(n=0, maximum=10):\r\n    while True:\r\n        yield n\r\n        n += 1\r\n\r\n        if n >= maximum:\r\n            return\r\n\r\n\r\ngen = generator(maximum=1000000)\r\nfor n in gen:\r\n    print(n)\r\n",
