        "code": "# Overlay de desenvolvimento: API com --reload.\r\n# Uso: docker compose -f docker-compose.yml -f docker-compose.dev.yml up --build -d\r\nservices:\r\n  api:\r\n    command: uvicorn app.main:app --host 0.0.0.0 --port 8000 --reload --timeout-graceful-shutdown 3\r\n",
