        "title": "GroupNode.tsx",
        "description": "Código-fonte: `frontend/src/components/map/GroupNode.tsx`",
        "file": "frontend/src/components/map/GroupNode.tsx",
        "code": "import type { NodeProps } from \"@xyflow/react\";\r\n\r\nexport default function GroupNode({ data }: NodeProps) {\r\n  return (\r\n    <div\r\n      className=\"sa-map-group-node\"\r\n      style={{\r\n        width: (data.width as number) || 300,\r\n        height: (data.height as number) || 200,\r\n        borderColor: (data.color as string) || \"var(--sa-border-strong)\",\r\n      }}\r\n    >\r\n      <span className=\"sa-map-group-label\">{data.label as string}</span>\r\n    </div>\r\n  );\r\n}\r\n",
        "implementation": [
          "path: frontend/src/components/map/GroupNode.tsx",
          "GitHub: https://github.com/CanonEngineer/SentinelAI/blob/main/frontend/src/components/map/GroupNode.tsx"
        ]
